  "description": "Chemical Guys HydroSuds Ceramic Car Wash Soap (CWS21264) combines high foaming wash performance with the protection of ceramic technology, making it the ultimate solution for cleaning and protecting your vehicle in one easy step.Formulated with advanced ceramic polymers, HydroSuds bonds to exterior surfaces to create a slick, hydrophobic layer that enhances gloss, depth, and water beading. The pH-balanced formula is gentle enough for regular use and safe for all exterior finishes, including paint, glass, wheels, and trim, without stripping existing wax, sealant, or ceramic coatings.Use HydroSuds Chemical Guys foam soap with a foam cannon for maximum suds, a garden hose foam gun for convenience, or the traditional two-bucket wash method for versatility. The thick foam clings to the surface, lifting dirt and grime away from the paint to reduce the risk of swirls and scratches.Ideal for cars, trucks, motorcycles, RVs, and boats, HydroSuds is a great addition to your car detailing kit, delivering professional results while making wash time more enjoyable with its refreshing berry scent. Whether you’re maintaining a daily driver or detailing a show car, HydroSuds car wash soap for foam cannons leaves your ride clean, glossy, and protected. This automotive cleaning product is great car enthusiasts and DIY detailers washing your car at home and for routine vehicle maintenance.",
